WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.070
When a repair has moved up the reporting chain, start in Escalations and open the ticket.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:08.760
Select Activity to read events with their actors and timestamps.

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.870
Then locate the Escalation Ladder.

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:13.100
The highlighted rung is the current level.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.670
Expand History to see the recorded reason for a past move.

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:20.390
A scheduled escalation is not evidence that the move has already happened.
